; GS huds.ltx:21 `hud_fov_factor = 1.25` is a MULTIPLIER of ITS base hud fov (0.5625); ours is an
; absolute value and our engine default is 0.45 -- that gap is why the weapon sat closer than in GS,
; both from the hip and in aim. 1.25 x 0.5625 = 0.703.
